{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "קוצים", :translit "kotzim", :gloss "thorns"} {:he "קוצים כסוחים", :translit "kotzim kesuchim", :gloss "thorns swept away"} {:he "באש יוצתו", :translit "ba'esh yivateh", :gloss "in fire it shall be kindled"} {:he "ואל תזרעו אל קוצים", :translit "ve'al tizre'u el kotzim", :gloss "and do not sow among thorns"} {:he "דועכו כאש קוצים", :translit "do'achu ke'esh kotzim", :gloss "they are extinguished like fire of thorns"} {:he "כי תצא אש אפי' מעצמה", :translit "ki yetze esh afi' me'atzmah", :gloss "if fire goes out even of itself"} {:he "נירו לכם ניר", :translit "niru lachem nir", :gloss "break up for yourselves fallow ground"} {:he "נירו", :translit "niro", :gloss "his fallow ground"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 4, :occurrences ["קוצים כסוחים" "באש יוצתו" "ואל תזרעו אל קוצים" "דועכו כאש קוצים"]} {:kind :other, :note "Links the four occurrences of קוצים to a chain of derashot: fire spreading by itself, plowing fallow ground, and the destruction of the wicked."}], :frame {:text "The Sages derive from Exodus 22:5 that when fire spreads 'if fire goes out, even of itself,' the liable party must pay even if the fire spread without human intent after ignition (Bava Kamma 60a). Jeremiah 4:3, 'Break up for yourselves fallow ground and sow not among thorns,' is interpreted there as an admonition directed at the wicked, who are compared to thorns consumed by fire (Bava Kamma 60a). Psalms 118:12, 'they are extinguished like fire of thorns,' likewise speaks of the wicked (Bava Kamma 60a). The Ba'al HaTurim links the four occurrences of קוצים to compress these interrelated derashot into a single word-chain.", :sources ["Bava Kamma 60a" "Jeremiah 4:3" "Psalms 118:12" "Isaiah (context of קוצים כסוחים)"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 4, :occurrences ["קוצים כסוחים" "באש יוצתו" "ואל תזרעו אל קוצים" "דועכו כאש קוצים"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "קוצים כסוחים", :refs ["Isaiah 33:12"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phrase "באש יוצתו", :refs ["2 Samuel 14:30" "Isaiah 33:12" "Jeremiah 51:58"], :n 3, :lens :plene-insensitive} {:phrase "ואל תזרעו אל קוצים", :refs ["Jeremiah 4:3"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phrase "דועכו כאש קוצים", :refs ["Psalms 118:12"], :n 1, :lens :plene-insensitive}]} {:kind :other, :note "Links the four occurrences of קוצים to a chain of derashot: fire spreading by itself, plowing fallow ground, and the destruction of the wicked.", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:18:27.557223281Z", :model "glm-5.2"}